    "detailed_description": "As a retired mercenary you decide to set up your own company to take on covert missions commissioned by governments and secret organizations.<br />\r\nGet ready to do all kinds of jobs like eliminating the most wanted terrorists or recovering vital merchandise.<br />\r\nAll represented in this top-down shooter game where you can play alone or with up to 4 friends in local multiplayer mode.<br />\r\nEach mission will test your ability to dodge, cover or even orient yourself through maps generated almost procedurally where each game will surprise you.<br />\r\nBy successfully completing missions you will get rewards in the form of money in the game, with which you can strengthen your team by hiring better soldiers and equipment.<br />\r\nAlso if what you want is just shoot and shoot and keep your position you can go directly to survival mode and you will face hordes of enemies <br />\r\nenemies that will try to leave you at the bottom of the leaderboards.<br />\r\nWhat are you waiting for to form the best mercenary team and start your shift of war!",
    "about_the_game": "As a retired mercenary you decide to set up your own company to take on covert missions commissioned by governments and secret organizations.<br />\r\nGet ready to do all kinds of jobs like eliminating the most wanted terrorists or recovering vital merchandise.<br />\r\nAll represented in this top-down shooter game where you can play alone or with up to 4 friends in local multiplayer mode.<br />\r\nEach mission will test your ability to dodge, cover or even orient yourself through maps generated almost procedurally where each game will surprise you.<br />\r\nBy successfully completing missions you will get rewards in the form of money in the game, with which you can strengthen your team by hiring better soldiers and equipment.<br />\r\nAlso if what you want is just shoot and shoot and keep your position you can go directly to survival mode and you will face hordes of enemies <br />\r\nenemies that will try to leave you at the bottom of the leaderboards.<br />\r\nWhat are you waiting for to form the best mercenary team and start your shift of war!",
